    "//": "CDF-only (P1e step 29): DDA's armor plates and IOTV protectors in BN armor format. Material mapping: ceramic -> ceramic; scrap/lc/mc steel -> steel; hc/ch steel -> hardsteel; qt steel -> superalloy; kevlar_layered -> kevlar; thermo_resin -> plastic; damaged_ceramic -> ceramic at reduced thickness. BN armor has one material list and an integer material_thickness for the whole item, and its resistance is the average resistance of the materials times the thickness. DDA's thicknesses are millimetres of a per-portion material (25 for ceramic) and cannot be copied: the values here keep DDA's tier ordering scrap < lc < mc < hc < ch < qt in bullet resistance and put the ceramic plates and the top tiers at about the level of BN's old MBR plate vests (bullet 90). Sizes, weights, volumes, prices, coverage, encumbrance and flags are DDA's."
